  "note": "Triennial election of the Gilford Town Commissioners, January 1929. The Belfast News-Letter nominations round-up states that there will be no contest for the Gilford Town Commissioners, and lists the members who will constitute the Board, with a further addition to be made later to fill a vacancy caused by death. The report adds that one more member would be added later to fill a vacancy caused by death. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026). Returned unopposed."
